     the Author, and any part of them.
1.3. "Official Sources" — only these pages of the Author:
     https://github.com/xxFireflyxx/FlowZap-Zapret-GUI
     https://gitlab.com/xx_firefly_xx/flowzap
1.4. "Official Build" — an archive or executable of the Software
     published by the Author in the releases section of an Official
     Source, without any modification.
1.5. "Distribution" — making the Software or any part of it available
     to others in any way: publishing, uploading to websites, catalogs,
     app stores, file-sharing services or messengers, or including it
     in other software, bundles or installers.

2. PERMITTED

Free of charge and without separate permission from the Author, you may:

2.1. Download Official Builds from Official Sources, install them and
     use them on any number of your own devices, including work
     devices.
2.2. View the source code of the Software and study how it works.
2.3. Build the Software from source and modify it solely for your own
     use on your own devices, without any Distribution of the result.
2.4. Share links to Official Sources.
2.5. Give an Official Build to other people free of charge, complete,
     unmodified and together with this file.
2.6. Create a copy (fork) of the repository using GitHub or GitLab
