     language or otherwise reworking it.
3.2. Distributing modified versions of the Software, your own builds,
     forks and derivative works.
3.3. Distributing the Software other than as allowed by sections 2.4
     and 2.5, including publishing it on other websites, mirrors and
     software catalogs.
3.4. Obtaining any benefit from the Software: selling it, charging for
     access, download, installation or setup, distributing it with
     advertising, including it in paid products or services, or
     collecting donations for access to it.
3.5. Removing or altering information about the Author or this file,
     or presenting the Software or any part of it as your own work.
3.6. Using the name "FlowZap" or the Software's icon for other software
     or builds, or in a way that suggests they were made or endorsed by
     the Author.
3.7. Using the source code of the Software to train or fine-tune neural
     networks or other machine learning systems.

All of the above is prohibited regardless of the means, including
through third parties, by automated means or piece by piece.

4. IDEAS AND CREDIT

4.1. The ideas, approaches and solutions the Software is built on may
